# The vmangos image's build context is this directory, and it copies docker/vmangos/bin/ and
# docker/vmangos/patches/ alone. So the context is those two folders and nothing else: no Blizzard
# file (a Data folder or an archive dropped in here by mistake), no .env with the database passwords
# and the admin code, no build output. The lines after the exceptions keep those out even of the two
# folders themselves, and Python's bytecode cache too (py_compile of vanillish-admin leaves one).
*
!docker/vmangos/bin/
!docker/vmangos/patches/
**/*.MPQ
**/*.mpq
# Any case, and a download's partial file (`dbc.MPQ.part`), as in datahost/.dockerignore.
**/*.[Mm][Pp][Qq]*
**/Data/
**/WTF/
.env
**/.env
**/target/
**/__pycache__/
